# Deploy Test
# Local operator state (mindgate state dirs created by the alice/bob shell
# script) stays untracked, but the runbook + scripts that drive the test
# are tracked so phase PRs can ship their playwright deploy-tests.
/deploy-test/*
!/deploy-test/deploy-test-script.md
!/deploy-test/test_script_Alice_Bob.sh
!/deploy-test/playwright/
!/deploy-test/playwright/**

